    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35369" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέλκω</span></b> , in 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be charged,
				imposed upon</i> an estate, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἐνελκομένου σοι φόρου ἢ
					ἐνελκυσθησομένου τὸ ἥμισυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PFlor.</u>
					370.14
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				5.1695.12
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>, etc.; of land, <i>to be assigned for forced
				cultivation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PFlor.
				50.75
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
